{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35271","headline":"送龙门令刘沧 · 张乔","name":"送龙门令刘沧","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"去宰龙门县，应思变化年。\n还将鲁儒政，又与晋人传。\n峭壁开中古，长河落半天。\n几乡因劝勉，耕稼满云烟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张乔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35271.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35271","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}